Description: screenshot, annotation and screen recording for GNOME
 Annota captures a region, a window or the whole screen and lets you mark
 it up with arrows, callouts, numbered steps, highlights and redaction.
 Every mark stays editable until export.
 .
 Annota works entirely offline: no account, no cloud service and no
 telemetry. Screen access goes through xdg-desktop-portal, so it works on
 Wayland and X11.
 .
 This is a pre-release; capturing and editing arrive with milestone 0.1.
